                                "sense_id": "5fdb83da-f9ec-366b-bbc4-2700abfa3d15",
                                "text": "For men of litrature t'endite so fast, them doth not sitte, / Enaunter in them, as in thee, thair pen outrun thair witt; […]"
                            },
