                                "example_id": "fef0d1c5-2134-49a9-91b3-6e4c6b9a2ea3",
                                "sense_id": "5fdb83da-f9ec-366b-bbc4-2700abfa3d15",
                                "text": "KORITTO: […] For day and night long doth she weare our stone into scrapings, enaunter she pay a grote to set her own."
